<script setup>
// 从 App.vue 拆出来的一块界面：状态和函数都在 App 里，按同样的名字 inject 进来，模板原样不动
import { inject } from 'vue'
import { ArrowUp, Brain, Check, CheckCheck, ChevronDown, ChevronRight, Copy, ImagePlus, LoaderCircle, MessageCircle, MessageSquare, PanelLeftClose, Pencil, Plus, SlidersHorizontal, Square, SquareMousePointer, X } from 'lucide-vue-next'
import ExecutionCard from '../chat/ExecutionCard.vue'
import ResultCard from '../chat/ResultCard.vue'
const {
  activeRun, annotations, applySuggestion, busy, chatBox, chooseAnswer, chooseProject, closeSelection,
  composer, composerIntent, copyMessage, currentRuns, customSuggestion, repairRun, selftests, discussSuggestion, dragging, dropImage, editAndResend,
  elementLabel, forgetFromCard, formatTime, hideGuide, imageInput, input, lastResult, leftOpen,
  locked, memoryCount, messages, model, modelMenu, openDialog, openMemory, page,
  pasteImage, pendingRef, pendingUser, pointAt, project, projects, reference, rightOpen,
  runAgent, saveNote, selected, selectionPlace, setMode, showChat, showGuide, showPanel,
  smallerRequest, stopAgent, switchModel, switchingModel, toAI, tool, undo, useRephrase
} = inject('studio')
</script>

<template>
<aside class="conversation-panel" :class="{ collapsed: !leftOpen || rightOpen }" :aria-label="$t('对话')">
  <label class="mobile-project-picker"><span>{{ $t('当前项目') }}</span><select :aria-label="$t('切换当前项目')" :value="project?.id || ''" :disabled="locked || !projects.length" @change="chooseProject($event.target.value)"><option v-if="!projects.length" value="">{{ $t('尚未创建项目') }}</option><option v-for="p in projects" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{ $t(p.name) }}</option></select></label>
  <div class="panel-header"><div class="side-tabs" role="tablist" :aria-label="$t('左侧面板')"><button type="button" role="tab" :aria-selected="!rightOpen" :class="{ active: !rightOpen }" @click="showChat"><MessageSquare :size="14" />{{ $t('对话') }}</button><button type="button" role="tab" :aria-selected="rightOpen" :class="{ active: rightOpen }" @click="showPanel"><component :is="tool === 'comment' ? MessageCircle : SlidersHorizontal" :size="14" />{{ tool === 'comment' ? $t('评论') : $t('属性') }}<span v-if="tool === 'comment' && annotations.length" class="count">{{ $t(annotations.length) }}</span></button></div><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="$t('收起左侧面板')" @click="leftOpen = false"><PanelLeftClose :size="16" /></button></div>

    <div ref="chatBox" class="messages" aria-live="polite">
      <div v-if="!messages.length && !pendingUser && showGuide" class="conversation-empty compact-guide"><h2>{{ $t('先聊清楚，再动手。') }}</h2><p>{{ $t('可以一起评价设计、比较方案；确定方向后，只改需要调整的位置。') }}</p><button v-for="suggestion in ['现在的设计怎么样？', '有哪些地方值得优化？', selected ? '调整选中区域的对齐' : '检查一下交互有没有漏的']" :key="suggestion" class="prompt-suggestion" :disabled="!page" @click="input = suggestion; toAI()">{{ $t(suggestion) }}<ChevronRight :size="14" /></button><button class="text-button dismiss-guide" @click="hideGuide">{{ $t('不再显示') }}</button></div>
      <article v-for="message in messages" :key="message.id" class="message" :class="message.role"><div class="message-author"><span>{{ message.role === 'user' ? $t('你') : $t('设计助手') }}</span><time>{{ formatTime(message.created_at) }}</time></div><ResultCard v-if="message.role === 'assistant' && (message.report || message.clarification || message.discussion || message.changed)" :result="message" :selftest="selftests[message.change_id]" :locked="locked" :can-undo="page?.last_undo_id === message.change_id" @undo="undo" @choose="chooseAnswer" @apply="applySuggestion" @discuss="discussSuggestion" @custom="customSuggestion" @rephrase="useRephrase" @forget="forgetFromCard" /><p v-else>{{ message.content }}</p><div class="message-tools"><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="$t('复制这条内容')" :title="$t('复制')" @click="copyMessage(message.report?.summary || message.discussion?.answer || message.content)"><Copy :size="13" /></button><button v-if="message.role === 'user'" class="icon-button" :aria-label="$t('编辑后重新发送')" :title="$t('编辑后重发')" :disabled="locked" @click="editAndResend(message)"><Pencil :size="13" /></button></div></article>
      <article v-if="pendingUser && !messages.some(m => m.role === 'user' && m.content === pendingUser && m === messages[messages.length - 1])" class="message user"><div class="message-author">{{ $t('你') }}</div><p>{{ pendingUser }}</p><img v-if="pendingRef" class="message-shot" :src="pendingRef.data_url" :alt="$t(pendingRef.name)"></article>
                  <ExecutionCard v-for="run in currentRuns" :key="run.id" :run="run" :locked="locked" @retry="runAgent(run.request, '', run.options)" @repair="repairRun(run)" @settings="openDialog('settings')" @select="setMode('select')" @fill="smallerRequest(run)" @point="pointAt(run)" @dismiss="run.status = 'dismissed'" @stop="stopAgent" />

    </div>
    <div class="composer-area">
      <div v-if="selected" class="selection-context"><SquareMousePointer :size="14" /><span>{{ elementLabel(selected) }}<small v-if="selectionPlace">{{ $t(selectionPlace) }}</small></span><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="$t('清除选中目标')" @click="closeSelection"><X :size="12" /></button></div>
      <button v-if="annotations.length" class="annotation-count batch-action" :disabled="locked" @click="runAgent($t('请逐条处理已记下的修改意见，保留其他区域。'), '', { intent: 'edit' })"><CheckCheck :size="14" />{{ $t('已记下 {0} 条，一起修改', [$t(annotations.length)]) }}<ArrowUp :size="14" /></button>
      <div v-if="reference" class="reference-attachment"><button class="reference-open" @click="openDialog('image')"><img :src="reference.data_url" :alt="$t('参考截图缩略图')"><span>{{ $t(reference.name) }}<small :class="{ warn: !model.supports_vision }">{{ !model.supports_vision ? $t('当前模型看不了图片') : reference.regions.length ? reference.regions.length + $t(' 个框选区域 · 点开修改') : $t('参考整张图 · 点开可圈选') }}</small></span></button><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="$t('移除参考截图')" :disabled="locked" @click="reference = null"><X :size="13" /></button></div>
      <div class="composer-mode" role="group" :aria-label="$t('对话方式')"><div class="mode-switch"><button v-for="option in [{ value: 'auto', label: '自动' }, { value: 'discuss', label: '只讨论' }, { value: 'edit', label: '直接改' }]" :key="option.value" type="button" :class="{ active: composerIntent === option.value }" :aria-pressed="composerIntent === option.value" :disabled="busy" @click="composerIntent = option.value">{{ $t(option.label) }}</button></div><span>{{ composerIntent === 'discuss' ? $t('不改代码') : composerIntent === 'edit' ? $t('局部修改') : $t('提问先聊，指令再改') }}</span></div>
      <div class="composer" :class="{ dragging }" @dragover.prevent="dragging = true" @dragleave.self="dragging = false" @drop.prevent="dropImage"><textarea ref="composer" v-model="input" @paste="pasteImage" :aria-label="$t('对话内容')" :placeholder="busy ? $t('可以先写好下一条消息…') : selected ? $t('聊聊这个位置，或者告诉我怎么改…') : $t('这个设计怎么样？或者，告诉我想怎么改…\n截图可以直接粘贴进来')"></textarea><div class="composer-actions"><button class="icon-button" :title="model.supports_vision ? $t('加截图：也可以直接粘贴（⌘/Ctrl + V）或拖进输入框') : $t('加截图（当前模型看不了图片，发送前要在设置里换模型）')" :aria-label="$t('添加参考截图')" :disabled="locked" @click="imageInput.click()"><ImagePlus :size="18" /></button><span v-if="!selected">⌘ / Ctrl ↵</span><span v-else class="composer-spacer"></span><button v-if="selected" class="quiet" :disabled="locked || !input.trim()" @click="saveNote">{{ $t('先记下') }}</button><button v-if="activeRun" type="button" class="outline stop-run" :disabled="!activeRun.runId || activeRun.stopping" :title="$t('停在下一步之前；已经改好的部分会保留并检查，可以撤销')" @click="stopAgent"><Square :size="12" />{{ activeRun.stopping ? $t('正在停止…') : $t('停止') }}</button><button v-else class="primary direct-modify" :disabled="locked || (!input.trim() && !annotations.length) || !page" :aria-label="composerIntent === 'edit' ? $t('执行修改') : $t('发送消息')" @click="runAgent()"><LoaderCircle v-if="busy" :size="15" class="spin" /><ArrowUp v-else :size="15" />{{ composerIntent === 'edit' ? $t('执行修改') : $t('发送') }}</button></div></div>
      <button v-if="project" class="model-status memory-status" :title="$t('AI 记住的约定和习惯：点开看、改、删')" @click="openMemory"><Brain :size="12" />{{ $t('记忆 {0}', [$t(memoryCount)]) }}</button><div class="model-switch"><button class="model-status" :aria-expanded="modelMenu" :title="$t('切换模型')" @click.stop="model.has_key ? (modelMenu = !modelMenu) : openDialog('settings')"><span class="status-dot" :class="{ connected: model.has_key }"></span>{{ model.has_key ? ((model.profiles || []).find(p => p.active)?.name || model.model) : $t('连接模型') }}<span v-if="lastResult?.usage?.total_tokens"> · {{ lastResult.usage.total_tokens.toLocaleString() }} tokens</span><ChevronDown :size="12" /></button>
        <div v-if="modelMenu" class="model-menu" role="menu" @click.stop><p>{{ $t('切换模型') }}</p><button v-for="p in model.profiles || []" :key="p.id" type="button" role="menuitemradio" :aria-checked="p.active" :class="{ active: p.active }" :disabled="locked || switchingModel" @click="switchModel(p)"><Check v-if="p.active" :size="13" /><i v-else></i><span><b>{{ p.name || p.model }}</b><small>{{ p.name ? p.model + ' · ' : '' }}{{ $t(p.host) }}{{ p.has_key ? '' : $t(' · 缺密钥') }}</small></span><em v-if="p.supports_vision">{{ $t('看图') }}</em></button><button type="button" class="manage" @click="modelMenu = false; openDialog('settings')"><Plus :size="13" />{{ $t('绑定或管理模型…') }}</button><small v-if="locked" class="menu-note">{{ $t('AI 正在处理，等它做完再切换') }}</small></div></div>
    </div>
</aside>
</template>
